  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Int&apos;l Planned Parenthood Federation IPPF is the worlds largest        federation of family planning organisations and gather 153 countries  and with activities in 177 countries. Sida&apos;s support is un-earmarked  corefunding together with many donors for the implementation of       IPPF&apos;s Strategic framework 2005-2015. The Activities are concentrated  to 45 focus countries, that are among the worlds poorest countries</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Int&apos;l Planned Parenthood Federation IPPF &#xe4;r v&#xe4;rldens st&#xf6;rsta federa-  tion som samlar SRH org i 153 l&#xe4;nder och med verksamhet i 177 l&#xe4;nder   Sidas st&#xf6;d &#xe4;r ett icke-&#xf6;ronm&#xe4;rkt samfinansierad insats tillsammans   med ett stort antal givare f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;rande av IPPF&apos;s Strategic   Framework 2005-2015. Verksamheten koncentreras till 45 focus l&#xe4;nder   som &#xe4;r v&#xe4;rldens fattigaste.</narrative>
  </description>
